                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111N39/3</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Minister in Belgium
                    </hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Whitlock</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-04T18:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 4, 1914, 6 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Regret telegram from parliamentary group arrived after war declared.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
